OL,3,AUS Army says controlled blast of       
OL,4,Aexplosives in Iowa was 'huge success'  
OL,6,FPlans to detonate the lead azide, a    
OL,7,Fhighly volatile compound reportedly at 
OL,8,Frisk of exploding on its own, were     
OL,9,Fpaused multiple times before           
OL,10,FWednesday's detonation following public
OL,11,Foutcry and legal challenges.           
